    "With that address set, the app can still reach the local server when the VPS is down — as long as this device is on the same network." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit dieser Adresse erreicht die App den lokalen Server auch bei ausgefallenem VPS — sofern dieses Gerät im selben Netzwerk ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With that address set, the app can still reach the local server when the VPS is down — as long as this device is on the same network."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con esa dirección configurada, la app puede llegar al servidor local aunque el VPS esté caído, siempre que este dispositivo esté en la misma red."
